Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.96,Default,2,0,0,0,,We're back. {ep 18}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.25,Default,San,0,0,0,,Welcome back. {ep 18}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:17.04,Default,San,0,0,0,,Was the trip fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:17.79,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:20.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san. Please go on a date with me next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:34.32,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1}{\K20}{\K36}Like {\K30}the {\K136}tra{\K91}ces {\K30}of {\K36}the {\K136}heart,{\K80} {\K67}no {\K93}halt{\K46} {\K62}at {\K37}the {\K458}places.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.67,0:00:21.26,Default,San,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:24.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Well, you broke your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:27.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was so looking forward to going on a trip with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:30.22,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop hitting on someone else's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:31.97,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Akki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:34.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio, of course you'll be coming with us on the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.81,0:00:35.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:45.49,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1}{\K20}{\K20}The {\K160}place {\K54}is {\K84}so {\K150}far {\K66}a{\K97}way{\K43} {\K52}be {\K85}far {\K77}a{\K115}part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:36.15,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.15,0:00:37.94,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Then let me come, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:41.57,Default,San,0,0,0,,Let's have a good time with just\Nthe three of us, Tomoya-san, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.57,0:00:43.86,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't leave me out!
