Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:11.21,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1}{\K20}{\K34}The {\K147}place {\K71}is {\K59}a {\K146}lofty {\K57}lord, {\K90}can't {\K58}meet{\K19} {\K56}no{\K54}bo{\K43}dy {\K51}put {\K149}on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:12.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.37,0:01:24.27,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1}{\K20}{\K61}We {\K154}will {\K71}lose {\K73}the {\K123}place, {\K73}so {\K210}lofty {\K77}which {\K399}changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:15.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:20.19,Default,San,0,0,0,,It hasn't changed, has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.07,0:01:24.99,Default,San,0,0,0,,I've left it just the way it was on the day she married you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.62,0:01:36.13,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1}{\K20}{\K86}Not {\K77}all {\K136}were {\K39}de{\K197}sired.{\K48} {\K47}How{\K91}ever, {\K137}we're {\K93}never {\K152}sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.99,0:01:27.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes, it hasn't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:30.07,Default,San,0,0,0,,Would you like to take those with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.91,0:01:32.45,Default,San,0,0,0,,Those dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:35.08,Default,San,0,0,0,,Ushio loves them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:50.55,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1}{\K20}{\K89}Still, {\K117}there {\K33}is {\K101}still {\K33}the {\K161}place.{\K52} {\K32}Far {\K35}a{\K87}way.{\K49} {\K57}Far {\K53}a{\K450}way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:41.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:42.13,Default,San,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.13,0:01:44.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I forced Ushio on you for all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:51.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's thanks to you I was able to realize that I'm a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:54.64,Default,San,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:57.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's a really good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:01:59.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:02.15,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,All right, next up is the imitation of Mikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:03.73,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Mikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:08.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But starting today, I will raise her myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:12.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I will raise her to be a strong and caring person like Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:20.71,Default,San,0,0,0,,When we changed our occupations for Nagisa, she was also five years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:30.26,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1}{\K20}{\K37}The {\K99}place {\K37}bu{\K54}ried {\K47}in {\K36}deep {\K186}snow.{\K43} {\K28}Like {\K34}the {\K140}co{\K42}llap{\K63}sing {\K29}ca{\K176}stle.
