Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:37.61,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Sanae, you're not one to talk about others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.62,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You haven't cried since that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.24,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:48.58,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Of course. Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:52.00,Default,San,0,0,0,,Well, I had something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.63,0:05:55.55,Default,San,0,0,0,,I had to raise Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:06:01.55,Default,San,0,0,0,,So it was good; I didn't have the chance to lose myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:03.47,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Five years, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:07.31,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We were saved by Ushio a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:09.90,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:13.02,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But even that has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:14.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:18.86,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Good work for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:22.66,Default,San,0,0,0,,It was nothing; we're a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:27.20,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's all right, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:30.62,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:32.88,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:34.96,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:37.96,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Even with all hope gone, I'll still help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:41.22,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll be here until you stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:43.60,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,So it's all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:16.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.21,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:18.67,Default,San,0,0,0,,Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:20.59,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Yeah, go and score!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:21.22,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.93,0:07:23.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You understand what he means?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:27.31,Default,San,0,0,0,,You'll get to live with your father starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.31,0:07:28.89,Default,San,0,0,0,,Be sure to be a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:29.81,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.23,0:07:35.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,On days I'm busy with work, can I still ask you to take her to or pick her up from kindergarten?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.52,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Sure, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:40.28,Default,San,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san, how about your...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:46.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I intend to visit him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.25,0:07:53.21,Default,Princ,0,0,0,,I heard the particulars from Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:56.29,Default,Princ,0,0,0,,It's nice meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:58.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Same here. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:03.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right then, Ushio. Daddy's off to work, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:05.72,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup. Have a good day, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:07.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.98,Default,People,0,0,0,,Look. That's Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.86,Default,People,0,0,0,,I wonder what he was doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:22.19,Default,People,0,0,0,,Did something happen with the Furukawas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.19,0:08:23.36,Default,People,0,0,0,,Family dispute, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I bet I would have snapped if this had happened a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.66,0:08:28.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:30.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm Okazaki Ushio's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:33.58,Default,People,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:38.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I've been leaving her at my wife's home due to circumstances beyond my control,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but we'll be living together starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:43.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I hope we'll get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:46.22,Default,People,0,0,0,,Oh, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:50.18,Default,People,0,0,0,,My child's a good friend of Ushio-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:52.10,Default,People,0,0,0,,I hope we'll get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:56.14,Default,Yus,0,0,0,,Really? So you'll be living with her from now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:59.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. Sorry for worrying you for all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:03.32,Default,Yus,0,0,0,,But won't it be hard to raise a small child alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:08.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san and the old man took care of the most critical days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:13.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No matter what I may face, it won't be anything compared to what those two faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:16.16,Default,Yus,0,0,0,,Come to me if you ever need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:20.25,Default,Yus,0,0,0,,The company will try to accommodate you as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:22.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, in that case, something right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:26.42,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm here to get you, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.30,0:09:31.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:37.27,Default,Princ,0,0,0,,Right now, it's the summer session,\Nso Ushio-chan's teacher's on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:39.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Holiday? Sick perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:42.23,Default,Princ,0,0,0,,She's off to a child-care seminar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:47.45,Default,Princ,0,0,0,,She'll be back next week, so you will meet her when she returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:48.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:51.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's your teacher like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.99,0:09:55.41,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Long hair, beautiful, and kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:09:56.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:10:01.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right, Daddy's going to go back to work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:04.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even if a stranger comes, don't open the door, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.88,0:10:05.51,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:09.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If anything happens, call Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:11.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You know how to make calls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.43,0:10:12.43,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:15.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll be back before dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:16.31,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:17.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:18.81,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Bye-bye,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:19.73,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.01,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:51.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's Daddy. My hands are full with stuff;\Nopen the door for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:58.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I brought them from the Furukawas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:02.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The Big Dango Family, your toys, and changes of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:04.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's put this somewhere first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:07.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Where do you think is best?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.45,0:11:13.41,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:15.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right. There it'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:26.00,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Can you cook, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll learn little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll learn together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:31.01,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:33.64,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:37.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kouko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:41.73,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I wonder how many years it has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:43.60,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,So she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:45.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My daughter, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:47.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio, say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.23,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:51.99,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Yes, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.99,0:11:53.45,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I'm Yoshino Kouko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:57.08,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,So she's Nagisa-chan's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:11:59.83,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,She does resemble her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:06.71,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll grow up to be a strong and cute girl like Nagisa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:09.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I hope so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:11.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She used to be Mommy's teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:16.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Yoshino-san told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:18.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I heard your sister got discharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:19.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.31,0:12:26.48,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Yes. The doctors said it's a miracle,\Nbut we always believed she'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:30.19,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I'm actually with her today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:33.90,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Fu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:43.46,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:44.87,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,They're my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:49.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:02.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What an interesting sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:06.44,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Fu-chan; he's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:08.81,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,This is my younger sister, Fuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.94,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,This is Okazaki-san and Ushio-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:13.74,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:15.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:16.70,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:21.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.62,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,She's cute! Can I give her a hug?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:27.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You didn't even wait for an answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:30.25,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Stop it, Fu-chan. You're being rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.75,0:13:34.42,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. She's like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:36.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How old is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:38.64,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,The same age as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:45.31,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,But since she's been sleeping all these years, she still thinks she's a freshman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:48.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why does she look no different from Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:53.07,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,You're both very rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:56.61,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,Fuko's mad, so Fuko's going to make her Fuko's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:59.57,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Stop saying nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:01.91,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,It's not going to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.91,0:14:02.58,Default,2,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:05.54,Default,Fuk,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:14.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She was a little strange, but it was nice that you made a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:15.17,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:20.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio, I don't have to go to work tomorrow. Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:21.97,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Another trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:23.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:32.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You like the Big Dango Family, too? {ep 18}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:36.69,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Sanae-san said this is how Mommy smelled. {ep 18}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:37.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:39.90,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:15:13.23,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}Note: The radio is broadcasting the results of a horserace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:00.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm home. {ep 18}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.78,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Ah, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:32.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:33.92,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:37.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've gotten old, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.59,0:15:38.42,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:42.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's your granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:46.26,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:48.51,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:53.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Have you been here all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:55.77,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.36,0:15:59.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I met your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I went on a trip with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Way up north.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:09.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The place you took me once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:13.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I heard a lot of stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It made me think that you must have been through many hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:21.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I remembered a lot of things from the past, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:26.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.43,0:16:28.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:33.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think it's all right for you to rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:36.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How about going home?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:38.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your mother's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:43.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right where you took my hand and promised to raise me with your own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:51.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:54.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So relax now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:58.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go home and live with your mother for her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:16:59.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:20.36,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Is it... over now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:21.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:25.61,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Have I accomplished it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:42.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You sacrificed everything and raised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:49.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You spent your entire life on a worthless son like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:52.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.31,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:18:01.65,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,So I managed to do it without even knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:07.65,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,How great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:13.33,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:39.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll put a change of clothes and some money in, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.56,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:44.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll give her a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.94,0:18:47.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't lose your bags on the way, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:49.45,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.70,0:18:52.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll handle the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:55.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the debts, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.37,0:18:57.58,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:01.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio, say bye-bye to your granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:03.54,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:04.25,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.05,0:19:12.84,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:15.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.76,0:19:16.31,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:20.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't drink too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:21.73,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:24.36,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:26.52,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,There, have a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.07,0:19:28.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't smoke too much, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:30.07,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:34.74,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Dad's got to go again, but don't eat too much, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:36.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Live long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:39.33,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Sorry I have to leave you alone all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:42.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll definitely go to show my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:45.50,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I'll make our dinner when I come back, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:47.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I will go, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.55,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,We'll eat it together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.76,0:19:56.43,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,All right, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:06.52,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Tomoya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:11.65,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.95,0:20:23.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:26.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:30.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:33.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you for all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:34.51,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:42.60,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I'll go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:44.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.27,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,You, too, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:21:00.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wonder if he had a good life or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:08.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He lost his dearest person at the happiest time in his life, and he's been alone with me ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:13.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He kept working for an ungrateful son like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.01,0:21:16.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wonder if he had a good life like that or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.77,0:21:23.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.08,0:21:51.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is it, Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:53.38,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Light...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:55.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, is it bright there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:56.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.89,0:22:09.85,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5\pos(436.5,840)}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:04.41,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:04.41,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:12.00,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:12.00,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.82,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.36,0:23:45.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Ushio. You're going to have a visitor tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.53,0:23:48.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you know any games, Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.49,0:23:51.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio, say "I'm going" to Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.46,0:23:53.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:23:55.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, so wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.05,0:23:59.63,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:01.88,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.76,0:24:09.72,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 20
